    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3f42431b-adc5-5022-a0c3-cfb1aa2dd7cc" activityNameId="4b65fa33-c8d4-56b8-90a7-c7977735d1a2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glazing, double (2-IV), U&lt;1.1 W/m2K, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glazing, double (2-IV), U&lt;1.1 W/m2K, at plant
This dataset describes the processes included in the production of 1.06m2 (corresponding to 1m2 visible area) double glazing (2-IV) with a U-value below 1.1 W/m2K. It can be applied for double glazing used in the building sector. 1 m2 visible glazing area has a final weight of 20 kg.;
UUID: d748dcfa-265f-397e-94d9-b44e7aafac60
Included in this dataset are the materials and production processes of 1.06m2 (corresponding to 1m2 visible area) double glazing (2-IV) with a U-value below 1.1 W/m2K including disposal of waste water and production wastes.
Location: Data estimated according to a European company.
Technology: The technology represents average European production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company documentation, calculations based on geometry 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that this dataset is representative for the whole Europe is taken into account in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d748dcfa-265f-397e-94d9-b44e7aafac60.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
